1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,359
For a while now I've only been walking I haven't really been running.
最近这段时间我一直只散步，没怎么跑步。

2
00:00:03,359 --> 00:00:07,310
But today it felt so good that I decided to do walk run intervals.
但今天状态很好，所以决定走跑交替。

3
00:00:07,320 --> 00:00:09,760
And it was so nice to do a little bit of running.
能稍微跑一跑，感觉很不错。

4
00:00:09,760 --> 00:00:19,170
After I was done I did a quick stretch and then headed inside to chug some water.
结束后，我简单拉伸了一下，就回屋大口喝水。

5
00:00:26,120 --> 00:00:29,680
So on this day I had some errands to run in the afternoon.
这天下午还有些杂事要外出处理。

6
00:00:29,680 --> 00:00:32,320
So I wanted to go ahead and jump in the shower.
所以我想先去冲个澡。

7
00:00:32,320 --> 00:00:42,239
So I could let my hair air dry while I did my morning devotional and planning time.
这样在我做早晨灵修和规划时，头发就能自然晾干。

8
00:00:42,239 --> 00:00:46,640
After my shower I did my skincare routine brushed my hair and then got dressed.
洗完澡，我护肤、梳头，再穿好衣服。

9
00:00:55,960 --> 00:01:02,400
Most days I will do my devotional and planning time here at the breakfast table or in the office.
大多数时候，我会在早餐桌边或书房做灵修和规划。

10
00:01:02,400 --> 00:01:04,600
And today I chose the breakfast table.
今天我选了早餐桌。

11
00:01:04,600 --> 00:01:08,120
And I was actually starting to get a little bit hungry but it wasn't quite lunchtime.
我开始有点饿，不过还没到午饭时间。

12
00:01:08,120 --> 00:01:10,600
So I got myself a protein shake.
所以我给自己拿了一杯蛋白饮品。

13
00:01:10,600 --> 00:01:15,519
So this is the devotional I've been doing and it's called pumpkin spice for your soul.
这是我最近读的灵修读物，名字叫 Pumpkin Spice for Your Soul。

14
00:01:15,519 --> 00:01:19,680
And a sweet follower just suggested it to me over on instagram.
一位很贴心的关注者在 Instagram 上推荐给我的。

15
00:01:19,680 --> 00:01:36,160
And it is such a great little devotional for fall.
对我来说，这是一本很适合秋天的灵修小书。

16
00:01:36,160 --> 00:01:38,759
After I get done with my devotional I'll pull out my planner.
灵修读完，我会拿出计划本。

17
00:01:38,759 --> 00:01:42,919
And look at what we have for the day or plan what we need to do that day.
看看当天有什么安排，或者计划当天需要做什么。

18
00:01:42,919 --> 00:01:46,079
And then take a look at what we have going on for the rest of the week.
再看看这周剩余时间有什么安排。

19
00:01:46,079 --> 00:01:50,840
And I'll also highlight some of the things that I forgot to highlight off my list from the day before.
我还会把前一天忘记标记完成的几件事涂亮。

20
00:01:50,840 --> 00:01:55,519
Or earlier in the week or even highlight things I've already done for the day.
或者标记这周早些时候、甚至今天已经做完的事。

21
00:01:55,519 --> 00:01:58,600
I absolutely love highlighting things off of my list.
我真的很喜欢在清单上标记完成。

22
00:01:58,600 --> 00:02:03,400
So sometimes I'll even add things to my list that I've already done just so I can highlight it.
有时候我甚至把已经做完的事再加上去，只为能把它涂亮。

23
00:02:03,400 --> 00:02:05,590
Y'all will have to let me know if you do that too.
你们也这样的话，一定告诉我。

24
00:02:05,600 --> 00:02:07,359
Next I pull out my little notebook.
接下来我拿出小笔记本。

25
00:02:07,359 --> 00:02:11,639
And this is where I like to plan out my videos or even do brain dumps.
我在里面规划视频，也会把脑中的想法一次写下来。

26
00:02:11,639 --> 00:02:15,320
I feel like I always have so many things going through my head.
我总觉得脑子里转着好多事。

27
00:02:15,320 --> 00:02:17,990
And sometimes it's actually hard for me to sleep at night.
有时候晚上真的很难入睡。

28
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:20,600
Because I'll be thinking of all the things that I need to do.
因为我会想所有需要做的事。

29
00:02:20,600 --> 00:02:23,559
Or I'll have all these ideas that just pop into my head.
或者突然冒出一堆点子。

30
00:02:23,559 --> 00:02:26,280
So if I do these brain dumps every now and then.
所以我时不时会做这种想法记录。

31
00:02:26,280 --> 00:02:31,280
And write down all of my ideas on paper it actually helps clear my head a little bit.
把所有想法写到纸上，确实能让我头脑清爽一点。

32
00:02:31,280 --> 00:02:36,800
Now I'm going to go ahead and blow dry and curl my hair and then put some makeup on for the day.
现在我要吹干、卷一下头发，再化妆准备一天。

33
00:02:36,800 --> 00:02:41,119
So like I said earlier I had a few errands to run later in the afternoon.
像之前说的，我下午晚点有些杂事要办。

34
00:02:41,119 --> 00:02:43,439
So I did take a shower and got ready.
所以今天我先洗澡、收拾好了。

35
00:02:43,439 --> 00:02:46,720
But sometimes I'll actually wait and take a shower at night.
但有时候，我会等到晚上再洗。

36
00:02:46,720 --> 00:02:53,240
Especially if I know I'm going to be outside with the kids later or doing something that's going to get me sweaty again.
尤其是如果知道晚点还要带孩子去户外，或者做些又会出汗的事。

37
00:02:53,240 --> 00:03:09,700
Um then I'll just let my hair air dry overnight so I'm not always um blow drying it.
那我就让头发过夜自然晾干，所以也不是每次都吹干。
